  <script type="application/json" data-target="react-app.embeddedData">{"payload":{"allShortcutsEnabled":true,"fileTree":{"":{"items":[{"name":"Linjär_regression_med_gradient_descent.ipynb","path":"Linjär_regression_med_gradient_descent.ipynb","contentType":"file"},{"name":"README.md","path":"README.md","contentType":"file"}],"totalCount":2}},"fileTreeProcessingTime":2.877792,"foldersToFetch":[],"repo":{"id":835859559,"defaultBranch":"main","name":"TheMadMathematician","ownerLogin":"TheMadMathematician","currentUserCanPush":true,"isFork":false,"isEmpty":false,"createdAt":"2024-07-30T19:10:48.000+02:00","ownerAvatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177046092?v=4","public":true,"private":false,"isOrgOwned":false},"codeLineWrapEnabled":false,"symbolsExpanded":false,"treeExpanded":true,"refInfo":{"name":"main","listCacheKey":"v0:1722359582.0","canEdit":true,"refType":"branch","currentOid":"32e317a471afefab6ca8467619d38ce3cb4a8ca3"},"path":"Linjär_regression_med_gradient_descent.ipynb","currentUser":{"id":177046092,"login":"TheMadMathematician","userEmail":"jonas.hall@norrtalje.se"},"blob":{"rawLines":["{","  \"nbformat\": 4,","  \"nbformat_minor\": 0,","  \"metadata\": {","    \"colab\": {","      \"provenance\": [],","      \"include_colab_link\": true","    },","    \"kernelspec\": {","      \"name\": \"python3\",","      \"display_name\": \"Python 3\"","    },","    \"language_info\": {","      \"name\": \"python\"","    }","  },","  \"cells\": [","    {","      \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",","      \"metadata\": {","        \"id\": \"view-in-github\",","        \"colab_type\": \"text\"","      },","      \"source\": [","        \"\u003ca href=\\\"https://colab.research.google.com/github/TheMadMathematician/TheMadMathematician/blob/main/Linj%C3%A4r_regression_med_gradient_descent.ipynb\\\" target=\\\"_parent\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg\\\" alt=\\\"Open In Colab\\\"/\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\"","      ]","    },","    {","      \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",","      \"source\": [","        \"# Att använda gradientnedstigning med en linjär modell\\n\",","        \"Nu ska vi titta på hur gradientnedstigning fungerar för att anpassa en linjär modell\\n\",","        \"till ett dataset. Vi kommer att gå igenom 5 iterationer av gradientnedstigning och\\n\",","        \"se hur modellen förbättras steg för steg.\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"## Instruktioner:\\n\",","        \"- Kör varje kodcell i tur och ordning genom att trycka på \\\"▶\\\" (kör-knappen).\\n\",","        \"- Läs förklaringen innan varje cell för att förstå vad som händer.\\n\"","      ],","      \"metadata\": {","        \"id\": \"UxkCA7J4HiFf\"","      }","    },","    {","      \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",","      \"source\": [","        \"## Steg 1: Generera datapunkter\\n\",","        \"Här genereras datapunkter som vi kommer att använda för att träna vår modell.\\n\",","        \"Varje punkt består av \\\\( X \\\\)-värde (oberoende variabel) och \\\\( y \\\\)-värde (beroende variabel).\\n\"","      ],","      \"metadata\": {","        \"id\": \"z22KvFMZHyfj\"","      }","    },","    {","      \"cell_type\": \"code\",","      \"execution_count\": 10,","      \"metadata\": {","        \"id\": \"tb1kxtONHVQL\",","        \"outputId\": \"8d706713-a765-4ff7-d9e6-c6020a481990\",","        \"colab\": {","          \"base_uri\": \"https://localhost:8080/\",","          \"height\": 472","        }","      },","      \"outputs\": [","        {","          \"output_type\": \"display_data\",","          \"data\": {","            \"text/plain\": [","              \"\u003cFigure size 640x480 with 1 Axes\u003e\"","            ],","            \"image/png\": \"\\n\"","          },","          \"metadata\": {}","        }","      ],","      \"source\": [","        \"import numpy as np\\n\",","        \"import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"# Generera data med brus\\n\",","        \"np.random.seed(42)\\n\",","        \"X = 2 * np.random.rand(100, 1)\\n\",","        \"y = 4 + 3 * X + np.random.randn(100, 1)  # Linjär relation med brus\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"# Plotta data\\n\",","        \"plt.scatter(X, y, label=\\\"Datapunkter\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.xlabel(\\\"X\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.ylabel(\\\"y\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.title(\\\"Genererade datapunkter\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.legend()\\n\",","        \"plt.show()\\n\"","      ]","    },","    {","      \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",","      \"source\": [","        \"## Steg 2: Förbereda modellen\\n\",","        \"Här skapar vi en enkel linjär modell med en slumpmässigt vald vikt \\\\( w \\\\) och bias \\\\( b \\\\).\\n\",","        \"Dessa parametrar kommer att justeras under varje iteration av gradientnedstigning.\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"Vi bestämmer också vår \\\"Learning Rate\\\", som avgör hur stora justeringar modellen ska göra på sina vikter vid varje iteration. En hög Learning Rate kan göra att modellen lär sig snabbare men riskerar att missa den bästa lösningen, medan en låg Learning Rate ger noggrannare justeringar men kan ta längre tid.\\n\"","      ],","      \"metadata\": {","        \"id\": \"SHXTT1UweEUM\"","      }","    },","    {","      \"cell_type\": \"code\",","      \"source\": [","        \"# Initialisering av parametrar\\n\",","        \"w = np.random.randn(1)  # Vikt\\n\",","        \"b = np.random.randn(1)  # Bias\\n\",","        \"learning_rate = 0.1  # Learning Rate\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"print(f\\\"Startvärden: w = {w[0]:.2f}, b = {b[0]:.2f}\\\")\\n\"","      ],","      \"metadata\": {","        \"id\": \"FI7NjRtieJkN\",","        \"outputId\": \"2751cbc3-8046-4f2c-dcb0-cb0558273cf5\",","        \"colab\": {","          \"base_uri\": \"https://localhost:8080/\"","        }","      },","      \"execution_count\": 14,","      \"outputs\": [","        {","          \"output_type\": \"stream\",","          \"name\": \"stdout\",","          \"text\": [","            \"Startvärden: w = -1.07, b = 0.48\\n\"","          ]","        }","      ]","    },","    {","      \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",","      \"source\": [","        \"## Steg 3: Första iterationen av gradientnedstigning\\n\",","        \"Den första iterationen justerar vikten \\\\( w \\\\) och bias \\\\( b \\\\) baserat på gradienten av förlustfunktionen.\\n\",","        \"Se hur den röda linjen börjar anpassa sig till datapunkterna.\\n\"","      ],","      \"metadata\": {","        \"id\": \"NODsb6UveP4T\"","      }","    },","    {","      \"cell_type\": \"code\",","      \"source\": [","        \"# Iteration 1\\n\",","        \"y_pred = w * X + b  # Förutsägelse\\n\",","        \"loss = (1 / len(X)) * np.sum((y_pred - y) ** 2)  # Förlust (MSE)\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"# Beräkna gradienter\\n\",","        \"dw = (2 / len(X)) * np.sum(X * (y_pred - y))\\n\",","        \"db = (2 / len(X)) * np.sum(y_pred - y)\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"# Uppdatera parametrar\\n\",","        \"w -= learning_rate * dw\\n\",","        \"b -= learning_rate * db\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"# Plotta anpassad linje\\n\",","        \"plt.scatter(X, y, label=\\\"Datapunkter\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.plot(X, w * X + b, color=\\\"red\\\", label=\\\"Modell efter iteration 1\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.xlabel(\\\"X\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.ylabel(\\\"y\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.legend()\\n\",","        \"plt.title(\\\"Gradientnedstigning: Iteration 1\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.show()\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"print(f\\\"Efter iteration 1: w = {w[0]:.2f}, b = {b[0]:.2f}, Förlust = {loss:.4f}\\\")\\n\"","      ],","      \"metadata\": {","        \"id\": \"fY3tqjZZeU_v\",","        \"outputId\": \"7bc39bd2-c08e-4ac2-e7df-2fe11acc1260\",","        \"colab\": {","          \"base_uri\": \"https://localhost:8080/\",","          \"height\": 489","        }","      },","      \"execution_count\": 18,","      \"outputs\": [","        {","          \"output_type\": \"display_data\",","          \"data\": {","            \"text/plain\": [","              \"\u003cFigure size 640x480 with 1 Axes\u003e\"","            ],","            \"image/png\": \"\\n\"","          },","          \"metadata\": {}","        },","        {","          \"output_type\": \"stream\",","          \"name\": \"stdout\",","          \"text\": [","            \"Efter iteration 1: w = 2.44, b = 3.63, Förlust = 3.2333\\n\"","          ]","        }","      ]","    },","    {","      \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",","      \"source\": [","        \"## Iteration 2\\n\",","        \"Under iteration 2 fortsätter modellen att förbättra sin anpassning till datapunkterna.\\n\"","      ],","      \"metadata\": {","        \"id\": \"xln3IbUWeXj4\"","      }","    },","    {","      \"cell_type\": \"code\",","      \"source\": [","        \"# Iteration 2\\n\",","        \"y_pred = w * X + b\\n\",","        \"loss = (1 / len(X)) * np.sum((y_pred - y) ** 2)\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"dw = (2 / len(X)) * np.sum(X * (y_pred - y))\\n\",","        \"db = (2 / len(X)) * np.sum(y_pred - y)\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"w -= learning_rate * dw\\n\",","        \"b -= learning_rate * db\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"plt.scatter(X, y, label=\\\"Datapunkter\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.plot(X, w * X + b, color=\\\"red\\\", label=\\\"Modell efter iteration 2\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.xlabel(\\\"X\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.ylabel(\\\"y\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.legend()\\n\",","        \"plt.title(\\\"Gradientnedstigning: Iteration 2\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.show()\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"print(f\\\"Efter iteration 2: w = {w[0]:.2f}, b = {b[0]:.2f}, Förlust = {loss:.4f}\\\")\\n\"","      ],","      \"metadata\": {","        \"id\": \"xm9zF5ipeqSE\",","        \"outputId\": \"4f806d50-987b-4b39-a383-98e0f24a6da1\",","        \"colab\": {","          \"base_uri\": \"https://localhost:8080/\",","          \"height\": 489","        }","      },","      \"execution_count\": 19,","      \"outputs\": [","        {","          \"output_type\": \"display_data\",","          \"data\": {","            \"text/plain\": [","              \"\u003cFigure size 640x480 with 1 Axes\u003e\"","            ],","            \"image/png\": \"\\n\"","          },","          \"metadata\": {}","        },","        {","          \"output_type\": \"stream\",","          \"name\": \"stdout\",","          \"text\": [","            \"Efter iteration 2: w = 2.63, b = 3.81, Förlust = 1.6481\\n\"","          ]","        }","      ]","    },","    {","      \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",","      \"source\": [","        \"## Iteration 3:\\n\",","        \"Modellen fortsätter att förbättras med nya vikter\"","      ],","      \"metadata\": {","        \"id\": \"7ys1JnWaeu0W\"","      }","    },","    {","      \"cell_type\": \"code\",","      \"source\": [","        \"# Iteration 3\\n\",","        \"y_pred = w * X + b\\n\",","        \"loss = (1 / len(X)) * np.sum((y_pred - y) ** 2)\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"dw = (2 / len(X)) * np.sum(X * (y_pred - y))\\n\",","        \"db = (2 / len(X)) * np.sum(y_pred - y)\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"w -= learning_rate * dw\\n\",","        \"b -= learning_rate * db\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"plt.scatter(X, y, label=\\\"Datapunkter\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.plot(X, w * X + b, color=\\\"red\\\", label=\\\"Modell efter iteration 3\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.xlabel(\\\"X\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.ylabel(\\\"y\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.legend()\\n\",","        \"plt.title(\\\"Gradientnedstigning: Iteration 3\\\")\\n\",","        \"plt.show()\\n\",","        \"\\n\",","        \"print(f\\\"Efter iteration 3: w = {w[0]:.2f}, b = {b[0]:.2f}, Förlust = {loss:.4f}\\\")\\n\"","      ],","      \"metadata\": {","        \"id\": \"QViXYXq1ewQq\",","        \"outputId\": \"93c327b7-55bf-4173-8494-d21c9b8d4b6a\",","        \"colab\": {","  